# SSH (port 22) only from this Mac and from Tailscale; dropped from every other network.
# Installed by install-pf-ssh.sh into pf anchor com.apple/150.jpaddison-ssh, which the stock
# /etc/pf.conf reaches through its `anchor "com.apple/*"` line.
# Turn off until next boot: sudo pfctl -a com.apple/150.jpaddison-ssh -F rules
pass in quick on lo0 proto tcp from any to any port 22
pass in quick inet proto tcp from 100.64.0.0/10 to any port 22
pass in quick inet6 proto tcp from fd7a:115c:a1e0::/48 to any port 22
block drop in quick proto tcp from any to any port 22
